{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:04.12] 20 years old, I done broke even (Yeah)\n[00:06.90] Gave yo' bitch back 'cause I don't need her (Uh-huh)\n[00:09.60] That’s a new adlib Pat, you been gone for a long time (Bitch)\n[Chorus]\n[00:12.86] He don't want no war (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:15.82] Skrrt, pull off Black Porsche (Ayy, yeah)\n[00:18.60] If we slidin', then we in a four-door, ayy (Yeah)\n[00:21.58] Four horny guns, that's four whores, ayy (What the fuck else?)\n[00:24.62] Good knife on an AK, sword (Graa, graa)\n[00:27.26] They don't even know what's finna happen, I'ma kill them boys (Let's go)\n[00:30.72] Leave 'em floating on the water like a board (What else?)\n[00:33.72] Suppressor on the .40, tck, tck, tck, it don't make no noise (Woah)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:36.60] Cha-ching (Grrt), break her back, I'ma break her back\n[00:39.82] Said she want me to smash, I'ma break her back (On god)\n[00:42.86] Yeah, I'ma stab her in her back but I won't call her back, yeah (On god)\n[00:45.88] Shoot her boyfriend in the chest, he havin' a heart attack, yeah (On god)\n[00:49.02] A dead bitch ass nigga, that's what he is (Uh)\n[00:51.56] I don't wanna talk to ya', make you talk to Jesus (Uh-huh)\n[00:55.00] Fuck her to Lucid Dreams, instrumental, remix (Uh)\n[00:57.66] Can't take the dick back I gave you, bitch you need it (Uh-huh)\n[01:00.96] If I smash on tour, bitch, I'm in the moment (On god)\n[01:04.18] I'm on a roll, bitch, so it don't mean shit (On god)\n[01:07.16] Out of space, kid, out of orbit (On god)\n[01:10.20] Fresher than a pack of minty mint Orbit (Let’s go)\n[Chorus]\n[01:13.62] He don't want no war (Ayy, yeah)\n[01:16.58] Skrrt, pull off Black Porsche (Ayy, yeah)\n[01:19.36] If we slidin', then we in a four-door, ayy (Ayy, yeah)\n[01:22.34] Four horny guns, that's four whores, ayy (Ayy, yeah)\n[01:25.38] Good knife on an AK, sword (Graa, graa)\n[01:28.02] They don't even know what's finna happen, I'ma kill them boys (Let's go)\n[01:31.50] Leave 'em floating on the water like a board (What else?)\n[01:33.92] Suppressor on the .40, tck, tck, tck, it don't make no noise (Woah)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:37.60] In the studio, feelin' like the man\n[01:40.22] Percy' pop, mix it with the syrup, don't do no Xans (No)\n[01:43.26] Look at that boy Juice he nodding off again (On god)\n[01:46.22] Sleeping through them interviews, repeat the question\n[01:49.04] Listen, everybody want a verse, they can't get it (Uh-nuh)\n[01:52.18] I need seven numbers like a bitch puttin' in her digits\n[01:55.06] I need some fellatio, lil' bitch, I ain't eatin' shit (Yeah)\n[01:57.92] Yo' nigga got you trippin', thinkin' every dude gon' eat that kitten, what? (On god)\n[02:01.48] High as a bitch, inside the Abyss, we invented that\n[02:04.62] Oh, that's a strong pint of lean, I need ten of that (On God)\n[02:07.74] You talkin' shit, we chalkin' shit, where that nigga at? (Uh)\n[02:10.46] I'ma go off his shit, put 'em in a coffin shit\n[02:12.52] Put an end to that, yeah (Yeah)\n[02:14.42] Shooter on my team, got the Rambo status (Uh-huh)\n[02:16.88] She ain't let me fuck back then\n[02:18.20] Fuck she mean, she gon' let me have it (On God)\n[02:20.10] Thinking back to when I was a kid, I was the fuckin' baddest (On God)\n[02:22.94] Grew up playin' with guns, shoot a movie with 'em, cinematic (Let's go)\n[Chorus]\n[02:26.54] He don't want no war (Yeah, yeah)\n[02:29.48] Skrrt, pull off Black Porsche (Ayy, yeah)\n[02:32.26] If we slidin', then we in a four-door, ayy (Ayy, yeah)\n[02:35.24] Four horny guns, that's four whores, ayy (Ayy, what the fuck else?)\n[02:39.10] Good knife on an AK, sword (Graa, graa)\n[02:40.94] They don't even know what's finna happen, I'ma kill them boys (On God)\n[02:44.38] Leave 'em floating on the water like a board (What the fuck else?)\n[02:47.48] Suppressor on the .40, tck, tck, tck, it don't make no noise (Woah-woah-woah-woah)","words":[[3.9,4.04,"[Intro]"],[4.06,4.12,"[00:04.12]"],[4.12,4.16,"20"],[4.2,4.52,"years"],[4.66,4.86,"old,"],[4.92